# Device Files Sheet

::summary
The read-only relay file browse (F-12), opened from the device detail's Browse files: directory and file rows relayed through the server — nothing runs on the device. Folder rows descend; the leading up-row ascends; file rows carry size + modified meta with a trailing Download.
::

::modal[name=device-files title="mbp — Browse files" width=420 placement=centered dismissible=true]

