## Renderer notes (consciously deferred)

- The browse renders as flat rows with an up-row and a path toolbar; the shipped treatment is a collapsible nav-tree — nav-tree block deferred to the block round.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
